    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a challenging survival world full of dangers, discoveries, and decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this single-player survival game, your survival is the focus. Gather resources, build your own base, and craft equipment to face the elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different biomes \u2013 from scorching deserts to icy snowscapes \u2013 each region presents new challenges. The right clothing is crucial: a straw hat will protect you from the sun, while a winter jacket is vital in the cold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find abandoned locations, loot valuable items, and face dangerous creatures. Firearms like pistols are rare but can be purchased from merchants for resources or currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to surviving, you can also build your own small farm: Buy animals from a merchant and breed animals to provide for yourself in the long term.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're on your own \u2013 how long can you survive?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a challenging survival world full of dangers, discoveries, and decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this single-player survival game, your survival is the focus. Gather resources, build your own base, and craft equipment to face the elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different biomes \u2013 from scorching deserts to icy snowscapes \u2013 each region presents new challenges. The right clothing is crucial: a straw hat will protect you from the sun, while a winter jacket is vital in the cold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find abandoned locations, loot valuable items, and face dangerous creatures. Firearms like pistols are rare but can be purchased from merchants for resources or currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to surviving, you can also build your own small farm: Buy animals from a merchant and breed animals to provide for yourself in the long term.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're on your own \u2013 how long can you survive?</p>",
    "short_description": "Survive in an Open-world island world consisting of diverse biomes. Build bridges to unlock new island areas. Fly a helicopter to explore the world. Build your base and craft what you need to survive at various workbenches.",
